  "description": "Unofficial .NET SDK for OpenCode: a typed client for the OpenCode 2.x server HTTP API (OpenCode 1.x servers are not supported), with server-sent event streams, PTY and persistent-PTY terminals over WebSockets, cursor pagination, typed errors, and a local server launcher. The package id is OpenCodeDotNet.Sdk; the assembly and every namespace are OpenCode.Sdk.",
